# 9. Canonical Job Model

```typescript
interface CanonicalJob {
  id: string;

  source: {
    platform: string;
    sourceJobId?: string;
    sourceUrl: string;
    applicationUrl: string;
  };

  company: {
    id: string;
    name: string;
    domain?: string;
