# 10. Deduplication Architecture

The same job can appear on multiple sources.

```mermaid
flowchart TD

    A[LinkedIn Listing]
    B[Naukri Listing]
    C[Indeed Listing]
    D[Adzuna Listing]
    E[Company Listing]

    A --> FINGERPRINT
    B --> FINGERPRINT
    C --> FINGERPRINT
    D --> FINGERPRINT
    E --> FINGERPRINT

    FINGERPRINT[Fingerprint Engine]

    FINGERPRINT --> EXACT[Exact Match]
    FINGERPRINT --> FUZZY[Fuzzy Similarity]
    FINGERPRINT --> SEMANTIC[Semantic Similarity]

    EXACT --> DECISION
    FUZZY --> DECISION
    SEMANTIC --> DECISION

    DECISION{Duplicate?}

    DECISION -->|Yes| MERGE[Merge Sources]
    DECISION -->|No| CREATE[Create Job]

    MERGE --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    CREATE --> DB
```

Fingerprint components:

```text
normalized company
normalized title
normalized location
normalized description
```

Priority:

```text
sourceJobId exact match
        ↓
normalized fingerprint
        ↓
fuzzy similarity
        ↓
semantic similarity
```

