# 13. Matching Engine

```mermaid
flowchart TD

    JOB[Canonical Job]
    PROFILE[Candidate Profile]

    JOB --> EXTRACT[Requirement Extraction]

    EXTRACT --> RULES[Deterministic Matcher]
    PROFILE --> RULES

    EXTRACT --> SEMANTIC[LLM Semantic Analysis]
    PROFILE --> SEMANTIC

    RULES --> SCORE[Score Aggregator]
    SEMANTIC --> SCORE

    SCORE --> RESULT[Match Result]

    RESULT --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
```

Example configurable scoring:

```text
Skills              40%
Experience          20%
Location            15%
Role Alignment      15%
Other Requirements  10%
```

The LLM should explain semantic relationships but should not invent candidate experience.

