# 18. Browser Automation Architecture

Browser automation is isolated into dedicated workers.

```mermaid
flowchart TD

    APP[Application Service]
        |
        v
    QUEUE[Browser Job Queue]
        |
        v
    POOL[Browser Worker Pool]
        |
        +--> W1[Worker 1]
        +--> W2[Worker 2]
        +--> W3[Worker 3]
        |
        v
    SESSION[Browser Session Manager]
        |
        v
    TARGET[Application Website]
```

Each worker should have:

- Isolated browser context
- Timeout
- Resource limits
- Domain allowlist where practical
- Action logging
- Screenshot capability for debugging
- Retry policy
- Session cleanup

