# 19. Human-in-the-Loop

Default application lifecycle:

```text
READY_TO_APPLY
      ↓
APPLICATION_PREPARED
      ↓
HUMAN_REVIEW
      ↓
APPROVED
      ↓
BROWSER_EXECUTION
      ↓
SUBMITTED
```

Pause when:

```text
CAPTCHA
OTP
MFA
Authentication challenge
Unknown form
Unexpected legal consent
Automation restriction
High-risk action
```

The system must not bypass these mechanisms.

