# 60. Cost Controls

AI calls should be minimized.

Use:

```text
Rules first
    ↓
Cheap deterministic filtering
    ↓
Only promising jobs → LLM
```

For example:

```text
10,000 discovered jobs
        ↓
Basic filters
        ↓
2,000 candidates
        ↓
Semantic analysis
        ↓
300 strong matches
        ↓
Resume generation
        ↓
20 applications
```

Do not generate a customized resume for every discovered job.

---

# 61. Caching Strategy

Cache:

```text
Company career page
ATS metadata
Job descriptions
LLM classification
Repeated normalization
```

Cache invalidation should be source-aware.

Do not cache application form state longer than necessary.

