# 71. Architectural Summary

The system is fundamentally five platforms connected together:

```text
1. JOB DISCOVERY PLATFORM
   APIs + ATS + Crawlers

2. JOB INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM
   Normalization + Deduplication + Matching

3. RESUME INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM
   Candidate Profile + AI + LaTeX + Versioning

4. APPLICATION AUTOMATION PLATFORM
   Form Understanding + Browser Workers + Human Approval

5. APPLICATION INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM
   Tracking + Analytics + Audit
```

The central architecture is:

```text
                 MANY JOB SOURCES
                       ↓
                  CONNECTORS
                       ↓
                 CANONICAL JOB
                       ↓
                 DEDUPLICATION
                       ↓
                JOB INTELLIGENCE
                       ↓
                 CANDIDATE MATCH
                       ↓
                  SHORTLIST
                       ↓
                RESUME ENGINE
                       ↓
                APPLICATION PREP
                       ↓
                 HUMAN REVIEW
                       ↓
             PERMITTED AUTOMATION
                       ↓
                APPLICATION
                       ↓
                  TRACKING
                       ↓
                  ANALYTICS
```

The architecture is enterprise-oriented in its boundaries, event model, security, observability, idempotency, failure handling, and scalability, while the initial implementation remains intentionally simple enough for a single developer and a single personal user.
